{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/54/91nx2d92dnvwoppaxvx6nhifvr8jlzw.mp3","text":"你身边没有恶灵存在，所以我可以走了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:9/96/27la0nu4iqt7jojq9jb29znxh3n8bpf.mp3","text":"记忆承载着命运，你的命运曾戛然而止，所以那些恶灵并没有继续纠缠你，可是它们的痕迹仍旧清晰可见......博士，请不要随便把我的话当耳旁风......为了你好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/64/eo4rltu2tjmvel3a4nmfzxvivj7iln0.mp3","text":"有什么事情的话可以和小莫提说，没关系，小莫提会帮忙的。在你沉入梦乡的时候，一切问题都会解决的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/91/jfrlyzt6g0lmxdpin74446xykfy8yez.mp3","text":"那些会让人哭出来的感情都只是小莫提的食粮，所以我不怎么哭，这样不好吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/db/g3e55yw9n1xsz2fef0fgwsfxq3xand1.mp3","text":"诅咒的真面目？你想看看小莫提里面是什么？不行......至少现在不行......小莫提也会疼的，对，是这样的，弄疼小莫提的人自己也会疼的哭鼻子的，没有骗你。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/19/3kcawte8ug4w0hmiig1b3kbfjvox817.mp3","text":"清单上还缺些东西：毛线球、用过的纽扣、新鲜的苹果、拉特兰的土、碾碎的显像管......博士，帮我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:4/40/gvqakt16tvst8gzipo19dtllyw902b9.mp3","text":"苹果，给你，只是多余的施术材料，我不喜欢浪费......谢谢？都说不是为了你特意准备的......欸，干嘛，别摸头......算了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/27/nk85cb0524og4uw41wcvgj9rjx5b8gx.mp3","text":"因为有小莫提在，所以我用不着情感，但是大家夸奖我的时候，我总觉得心里很奇怪......而且小莫提不想带走那些情感，我很不安......这样没关系？真的？那就......这样吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/4uextn47gi4rixnoimid2g0fstov16f.mp3","text":"博士，给你，这是小莫提的分身，请一定要把它带在身上......诅咒？不，不是的博士......博士收下的话，我就像是一直待在博士身边一样了......不行吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/9tdsbwamb9ltzdzwcr9x1o7hexqul8o.mp3","text":"安睡吧♪安睡吧♪被梦湮没吧♪","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:d/da/2mto17lekfekrkzlipqw3wwqdyise0e.mp3","text":"新名字是巫恋......这是小莫提......至于其他的事情......你最好不要知道，小莫提说过，这对大家都不好......","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/15/qmm88zvu7vs4v6st71yan8lokleu1ir.mp3","text":"这些对仪式没有帮助......","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5d/q80udsmzt2ulfoko6gaux7cha6ia4h9.mp3","text":"填入棉花、缝起嘴巴、塞上耳朵、盖上眼睛......新的人偶完成了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/554k49jkhffkrn0rqug2r5t3gno014u.mp3","text":"小莫提并不需要这样的仪式，但是......我......很开心，我会和它一起努力的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:4/44/alhm545h8lp9xvw4a42ms9ilnd6utki.mp3","text":"工作吗？知道了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:3/33/t8kx9gex5r6eklt6q819bz39kaicwzt.mp3","text":"要是能像小莫提一样听话，就好了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:0/03/dtil3pq6bekqgrywvt0ir1uq3ozi87a.mp3","text":"小莫提，该走了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/gu5hjsp7w9pj5x76nal5wk0mu32s84g.mp3","text":"今天的运势是......你们真不走运。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/7q1cc26ge23czfv9g24bd3aykjw4u0x.mp3","text":"怎么了？","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/kchga6xx0z3p5fgsxzl5mq69o7fszw4.mp3","text":"大家都准备好了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:5/57/r7flrc7kwid8zfd9zyqaiptk3quaq35.mp3","text":"玩耍的时间到了，小莫提。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/lkloqelr1t13ys4nvbouid0gi8qp5cq.mp3","text":"你们的怨恨，我收下了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/ix03v2vyz5yyg2bwz5nrfcix9b9by80.mp3","text":"去吧，莫提。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/1ak6dtwe7fime6qbcvch857l576ag3w.mp3","text":"安息吧，让大地拥抱一切。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/dww9tl7hm2c2afi4movig3094tnhkjv.mp3","text":"是谁？","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/05/n7cmh6hzq4sbrqtdhltxc3ncbdl1w9f.mp3","text":"你们回不了家了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/08/rwqxu95r5ejkbcr193nzxns3129gmy1.mp3","text":"恶灵，都消散了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/25/jlk8h4bkysbbs2ftlvi3di5o90m5977.mp3","text":"就像它们低语的那样，意料之中的胜利。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/6r49z525irf763ql8lrzljd17wa10tn.mp3","text":"有人逃走了，没关系，小莫提已经缠住了他们的命运......","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/9l5tj2y9o8wuyx6m2r7pxbcpeegcj4v.mp3","text":"诅咒......你们......","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/3qei1tmysdl1igonf72erbcknyh6h7f.mp3","text":"这里......有恶灵的气息......还不错。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4b/p9qgfyn1kbwbtockg9rkq6d7pia3yvs.mp3","text":"你要做什么？","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/qx5jdlham80vjjv48jyhktilouwrmlq.mp3","text":"要陪我做裁缝吗？小莫提也很开心......","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:1/14/7rukom8eqcpu9f48koyhbxbqgsirr67.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/3fd5cdw25eiiowaccv4a429di1ufhyh.mp3","text":"博士，我看到你从办公室出来了。今天外面有好多人......新年吗？好吵，他们都在干什么？小莫提不喜欢这样的节日，可以陪我做护身符吗？在里面放上苹果蒂，可以帮博士避开诅咒。","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/99esjszi5ezbp8k8xmcpvp4g1eu7xot.mp3","text":"你们好，博士，还有......","alt":"voice_cn/char_254_vodfox/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:2/29/8ytwle6zmje3j0zbg3mglzc9zvb9qpp.mp3","text":"你身边没有恶灵存在，所以我可以走了吗？","alt":"voice/char_254_vodfox/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/55/7y03lkjiulcinfpeaha1v440fvi1den.mp3","text":"记忆承载着命运，你的命运曾戛然而止，所以那些恶灵并没有继续纠缠你，可是它们的痕迹仍旧清晰可见......博士，请不要随便把我的话当耳旁风......为了你好。","alt":"voice/char_254_vodfox/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/36u9kesak0id4pzabh24dz0jyvkija6.mp3","text":"有什么事情的话可以和小莫提说，没关系，小莫提会帮忙的。在你沉入梦乡的时候，一切问题都会解决的。","alt":"voice/char_254_vodfox/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/1hzz5o8qqegcvfcy5n8oaz1wzlllsse.mp3","text":"那些会让人哭出来的感情都只是小莫提的食粮，所以我不怎么哭，这样不好吗？","alt":"voice/char_254_vodfox/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/18/ku63bz42lllmb22ixndyotki0mr016y.mp3","text":"诅咒的真面目？你想看看小莫提里面是什么？不行......至少现在不行......小莫提也会疼的，对，是这样的，弄疼小莫提的人自己也会疼的哭鼻子的，没有骗你。","alt":"voice/char_254_vodfox/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/m1vad8kiksphnftcowgugvm5hz0abm3.mp3","text":"清单上还缺些东西：毛线球、用过的纽扣、新鲜的苹果、拉特兰的土、碾碎的显像管......博士，帮我。","alt":"voice/char_254_vodfox/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/rli14tf9rtk18ca87yzx810tmze0pkp.mp3","text":"苹果，给你，只是多余的施术材料，我不喜欢浪费......谢谢？都说不是为了你特意准备的......欸，干嘛，别摸头......算了。","alt":"voice/char_254_vodfox/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/81/5ub128pu5843q99t6zrdivzmokbkiqe.mp3","text":"因为有小莫提在，所以我用不着情感，但是大家夸奖我的时候，我总觉得心里很奇怪......而且小莫提不想带走那些情感，我很不安......这样没关系？真的？那就......这样吧。","alt":"voice/char_254_vodfox/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/tm816qajmlmktd2vmdft8qbq6ul5k8n.mp3","text":"博士，给你，这是小莫提的分身，请一定要把它带在身上......诅咒？不，不是的博士......博士收下的话，我就像是一直待在博士身边一样了......不行吗？","alt":"voice/char_254_vodfox/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:0/05/f4rwh1zpptmsm40xz6elos6yk92bzv8.mp3","text":"安睡吧♪安睡吧♪被梦湮没吧♪","alt":"voice/char_254_vodfox/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/dqmxmjvb4mflrrph4qzt48czw38kbl7.mp3","text":"新名字是巫恋......这是小莫提......至于其他的事情......你最好不要知道，小莫提说过，这对大家都不好......","alt":"voice/char_254_vodfox/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/68/tqotw76aqrprz4bmadn5fy4zm1ulmf7.mp3","text":"这些对仪式没有帮助......","alt":"voice/char_254_vodfox/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/fwe1x3pcxmpmab4nxgleflez16m0745.mp3","text":"填入棉花、缝起嘴巴、塞上耳朵、盖上眼睛......新的人偶完成了。","alt":"voice/char_254_vodfox/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:8/80/6i67whv57y5lkp4b7xgjpny0hfnnboa.mp3","text":"小莫提并不需要这样的仪式，但是......我......很开心，我会和它一起努力的。","alt":"voice/char_254_vodfox/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/qtld9g4d4oici3uhvyifxadqepx8akw.mp3","text":"工作吗？知道了。","alt":"voice/char_254_vodfox/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:6/63/gpja1z7gf4per7ahryr0pk859vsezbe.mp3","text":"要是能像小莫提一样听话，就好了。","alt":"voice/char_254_vodfox/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:1/17/ioyxn1b8ahzm582l2dmi0szqfhm31w1.mp3","text":"小莫提，该走了。","alt":"voice/char_254_vodfox/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:5/51/1gs5f9z21jgv4zm06vfbp8mwlrmqzgt.mp3",